----------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream data sources
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The benchmark pipeline in this repository can fetch metadata from several
public life-science literature services. Users are responsible for complying
with each service's terms when running the pipeline:

- NCBI PubMed / PubMed Central
    https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/
- Europe PMC
    https://europepmc.org/Copyright
- Crossref
    https://www.crossref.org/documentation/retrieve-metadata/rest-api/terms/
- bioRxiv / medRxiv
    https://www.biorxiv.org/about/FAQ

Content retrieved from these services is subject to its original license
(for example, CC-BY for many Europe PMC Open Access articles). This
repository does not redistribute upstream content; release bundles produced
by the pipeline are published separately under their own data license and
governed by docs/release_governance_card.md.
